2)∫₀¹² M(t) dt = 45 − 25e^{-2} ≈ 41.617 gallons per minute","ambiguous_or_flawed":false},{"item":"d","brief_reasoning":"R differentiable ⇒ continuous; R(0)=70 > 60.1 > 50.3 = R(3); IVT gives c in (0,3).","final_answer":"Yes. R is continuous (differentiable), R(0)=70.0 and R(3)=50.3, and 50.3<60.1<70.0, so by the IVT there is c in (0,3)⊂(0,12) with R(c)=60.1.","ambiguous_or_flawed":false}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":668,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1208,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null},"usage":{"input_tokens":668,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1208,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"cost":0.067648}
